 ## Unreleased
 
+- Printed invoices show negative amounts in parentheses, ($12.00); `render_text(..., negatives="minus")`
+  keeps the minus sign.
 - Exported records carry amounts as integers in the currency's minor units (cents, yen, fils)
   instead of decimal strings, on the record and on each line.
 - Tax uses the rates in force on the invoice's issue date, which is now required.
